From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bastiaan van der Plaat <bastiaan.v.d.plaat@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:09:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Trim the menus for a handheld console

The main menu has Game, Options and Quit, without the multiplayer menus,
which need a network, and the video menu, whose brightness moved to
Options. Options has the effects volume, brightness, always run, the
crosshair and resetting the defaults, without the mouse, joystick, key
bindings, CD music, sound quality and console. Quitting is answered with
A too.
---
